WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to this FarmerPlus lesson.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
In this video we look at the key ideas you will use on your farm.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Watch closely, pause any time, and take notes as you go.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Healthy systems start with good daily habits and careful observation.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check your water, your plants and your records every single day.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Small problems caught early are easy to fix.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
When you finish, mark the lesson complete to track your progress.
